    <string name="mod_setting_title">Community moderation</string>
    <string name="mod_setting_off">Off: show everything</string>
    <string name="mod_setting_on">On: follow the community moderators</string>
    <string name="mod_setting_note_who">The community moderators record on the blockchain which accounts are banned and which posts are hidden, as on the Idena Social website. A moderator is an identity with at least 1,000,000 iDNA staked, or an account such an identity vouched for.</string>
    <string name="mod_setting_note_what">With it on, a post made while its author is banned is not shown. An older post of theirs, or a post hidden by the moderators, shows as a line while replies under it are shown, and goes otherwise; its text and pictures are not downloaded. Likes, tips and messages still count. Your node reads the moderators\' decisions: nothing is sent.</string>
