    <string name="mod_ban_note">Their posts made during the ban are not shown; older ones show as a line while answers under them are shown. Any moderator can unban.</string>
    <string name="mod_hide_note">It stays hidden until a moderator restores it, even if its author is never banned.</string>
    <string name="mod_hide_many_note">Each stays hidden until a moderator restores it. Posts hidden already are skipped.</string>
    <string name="mod_vouch_note">They can then ban and hide, as long as one vouch for them remains. You can have 5 vouches at a time.</string>
    <string name="mod_revoke_note">Every vouch for them ends, whoever made it: they are no moderator then, and can be banned.</string>
